# globalThis.__hookOfSomeTool = function hook() {}
# Under a name that the table does not list lies no setter of the engine or the host, and neither looks there: they look up the names that they have put on the global object.
# So the value goes into the heap and to nobody else, the function is not entered, and no native code answers a value nobody knows.
